#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186279110 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "288e49b0-f706-54de-86b7-a17248fe2408" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Parallelogram Spanned by Two Non-Parallel Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b5401c01-9b40-5421-97da-b5d4e2ef05d1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "11" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186279112}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b5401c01-9b40-5421-97da-b5d4e2ef05d1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "11" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186279112} :answer-field/id #uuid "8bd562a1-de76-57bf-8a2a-0fff1c9df0c4" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186279111}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045465 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "5b426326-b653-592b-bbad-842bee9a0bbe" :question/math-academy-id "q-320392" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979011/assets/6881c7b52de83103dcfc483ec25455781a4d399653e2369d28f6924327f8ee56.png)\n\nDetermine the area $A$ of the parallelogram in the figure.\n\n$\\,\\,A=$ {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "From the diagram, we get the vectors\n\n$$\n\\text{u}=⟨-3,2⟩,\\,\\text{v}=⟨1,3⟩.\n$$\n\nFirst, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}-3 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(-3)\\cdot 3-1\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =-9-2 \\\\  & =-11\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|-11|=11\n$$"}]}
